a-sapphire"], "text": "Typhlosion obscures itself behind a shimmering heat haze that it creates using its intensely hot flames. This Pokémon creates blazing explosive blasts that burn everything to cinders."}, {"versions": ["legends-arceus"], "text": "Said to purify lost, forsaken souls with its flames and guide them to the afterlife. I believe its form has been influenced by the energy of the sacred mountain towering at Hisui's center."}], "sprites_by_gen": {"generation-ii": {"crystal": {"normal": "https://raw.githubusercontent.com/PokeAPI/sprites/master/sprites/pokemon/versions/generation-ii/crystal/157.png", "shiny": "https://raw.githubusercontent.com/PokeAPI/sprites/master/sprites/pokemon/versions/generation-ii/crystal/shiny/157.png"}, "gold": {"normal": "https://raw.githubusercontent.com/PokeAPI/sprites/master/sprites/pokemon/versions/generation-ii/gold/157.png", "shiny": "https://raw.githubusercontent.com/PokeAPI/sprites/master/sprites/pokemon/versions/generation-ii/gold/shiny/157.png"}, "silver": {"normal": "https://raw.githubusercontent.com/PokeAPI/sprites/master/sprites/pokemon/versions/generation-ii/silver/157.png", "shiny": "https://raw.githubusercontent.com/PokeAPI/sprites/master/sprites/pokemon/versions/generation-ii/silver/shiny/157.png"}}, "generation-iii": {"emerald": {"normal": "https://raw.githubusercontent.com/PokeAPI/sprites/master/sprites/pokemon/versions/generation-iii/emerald/157.png", "shiny": "https://raw.githubusercontent.com/PokeAPI/sprites/master/sprites/pokemon/versions/generation-iii/emerald/shiny/157.png"}, "ruby-sapphire": {"normal": "https://raw.githubusercontent.com/PokeAPI/sprites/master/sprites/pokemon/versions/generation-iii/ruby-sapphire/157.png", "shiny": "https://raw.githubusercontent.com/PokeAPI/sprites/master/sprites/pokemon/versions/generation-iii/ruby-sapphire/shiny/157.png"}}, "generation-iv": {"diamond-pearl": {"normal": "https://raw.githubusercontent.com/PokeAPI/sprites/master/sprites/pokemon/versions/generation-iv/diam